              "value": "A street vendor preparing food at midnight. A man returning home from a long shift. An old woman sitting alone outside her house.",
              "speaker": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "the-world-3",
          "mood": "night-walk",
          "video": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dofpspduc/video/upload/f_mp4,vc_h264,q_auto:eco,w_960,c_limit,ac_none,fps_24/v1786843265/the_world_3_y4ujya.mp4",
          "image": null,
          "imageAlt": "A young couple arguing under a flickering streetlamp.",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "value": "A young couple arguing under a flickering light. A drunk man asleep beside the road. Somewhere, a child laughing in the distance.",
              "speaker": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "the-world-4",
          "mood": "night-walk",
          "video": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dofpspduc/video/upload/f_mp4,vc_h264,q_auto:eco,w_960,c_limit,ac_none,fps_24/v1786843265/the_world_4_tueic4.mp4",
          "image": null,
          "imageAlt": "A funeral procession passing beneath a glowing luxury billboard, a walled house behind it.",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "value": "A funeral procession beneath a billboard advertising luxury. A beggar asking for money outside a wealthy house behind a high wall. A homeless man sleeping beneath a bridge.",
              "speaker": null
            },
            {
              "blockType": "dialogue",
              "value": "This is the world I gave him.",
              "speaker": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "the-world-5",
          "mood": "night-walk",
          "video": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dofpspduc/video/upload/f_mp4,vc_h264,q_auto:eco,w_960,c_limit,ac_none,fps_24/v1786843265/the_world_5_frvuzd.mp4",
          "image": null,
          "imageAlt": "The father standing still at a crossroads, the empty town stretching in every direction.",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "value": "Everyone struggles to survive. Everyone wants money. Everyone wants recognition. Everyone wants to be loved. Everyone eventually becomes dust.",
              "speaker": null
            },
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "value": "And yet everyone wakes up tomorrow and does it again.",
              "speaker": null
            },
            {
              "blockType": "dialogue",
              "value": "What a strange species we are.",
              "speaker": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-question",
      "number": "III",
      "title": "The Question",
      "status": "published",
      "teaser": null,
      "scenes": [
        {
          "id": "the-question-1",
          "mood": "hillside-sunrise",
          "video": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dofpspduc/video/upload/f_mp4,vc_h264,q_auto:eco,w_960,c_limit,ac_none,fps_24/v1786843265/the_question_1_ilfuwi.mp4",
          "image": null,
          "imageAlt": "A lone figure on a hill overlooking a town, the first light of dawn on the horizon.",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "value": "He reaches a hill overlooking the town. The sun begins rising.",
              "speaker": null
            },
            {
              "blockType": "dialogue",
              "value": "If everything ends in death, what is the point?",
              "speaker": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "the-question-2",
          "mood": "hillside-sunrise",
          "video": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dofpspduc/video/upload/f_mp4,vc_h264,q_auto:eco,w_960,c_limit,ac_none,fps_24/v1786843265/the_question_2_c8svgg.mp4",
          "image": null,
          "imageAlt": "The same figure now simply sitting, watching the sunrise without moving.",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "value": "For the first time, he doesn’t try to answer.",
              "speaker": null
            },
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "value": "He simply sits. And watches the sunrise.",
              "speaker": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "the-question-3",
          "mood": "hillside-sunrise",
          "video": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dofpspduc/video/upload/f_mp4,vc_h264,q_auto:eco,w_960,c_limit,ac_none,fps_24/v1786843265/the_question_3_degzzg.mp4",
          "image": null,
          "imageAlt": "A small bird landing near the seated figure as the town below slowly wakes.",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "value": "A bird lands nearby. A child somewhere below laughs. Someone opens their shop. A woman hangs clothes outside.",
              "speaker": null
            },
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "value": "The world continues. Despite everything.",
              "speaker": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "the-question-4",
          "mood": "hillside-sunrise",
          "video": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dofpspduc/video/upload/f_mp4,vc_h264,q_auto:eco,w_960,c_limit,ac_none,fps_24/v1786843265/the_question_4_mykqst.mp4",
          "image": null,
          "imageAlt": "A small boy crouched over something tiny on the ground, calling out to his father.",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "value": "Then he remembers something his son said a few days earlier. The boy had found a tiny insect. He was fascinated by it. He ran to his father, shouting —",
              "speaker": null
            },
            {
              "blockType": "dialogue",
              "value": "Dad! Look!",
              "speaker": "His son"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "the-question-5",
          "mood": "hillside-sunrise",
          "video": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dofpspduc/video/upload/f_mp4,vc_h264,q_auto:eco,w_960,c_limit,ac_none,fps_24/v1786843265/the_question_5_u9ncnh.mp4",
          "image": null,
          "imageAlt": "The father, still seated on the hill, closing his eyes as the memory settles.",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "value": "The father had barely looked. He was busy.",
              "speaker": null
            },
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "value": "Now he remembers the boy’s face. Something inside him shifts.",
              "speaker": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-realization",
      "number": "IV",
      "title": "The Realization",
      "status": "published",
      "teaser": null,
      "scenes": [
        {
          "id": "the-realization-1",
          "mood": "hillside-sunrise-open",
          "video": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dofpspduc/video/upload/f_mp4,vc_h264,q_auto:eco,w_960,c_limit,ac_none,fps_24/v1786843265/the_realization_1_h5ga75.mp4",
          "image": null,
          "imageAlt": "Open sky above the hill, the light now brighter and less confined than before.",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "value": "He realizes he may have been asking the wrong question.",
              "speaker": null
            },
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "value": "He had been asking: “Is life worth living if it eventually ends?” But his son had never asked that.",
              "speaker": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "the-realization-2",
          "mood": "hillside-sunrise-open",
          "video": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dofpspduc/video/upload/f_mp4,vc_h264,q_auto:eco,w_960,c_limit,ac_none,fps_24/v1786843265/the_realization_2_kjseou.mp4",
          "image": null,
          "imageAlt": "A faint, warm afterimage of the boy and the insect, overlaid on the open sky.",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "value": "The boy didn’t need life to be eternal. He didn’t need a guarantee that suffering would never happen. He simply wanted —",
              "speaker": null
            },
            {
              "blockType": "dialogue",
              "value": "Dad, look.",
              "speaker": "His son"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "the-realization-3",
          "mood": "hillside-sunrise-open",
          "video": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dofpspduc/video/upload/f_mp4,vc_h264,q_auto:eco,w_960,c_limit,ac_none,fps_24/v1786843265/the_realization_3_s1beka.mp4",
          "image": null,
          "imageAlt": "Wide, open dawn sky, nearly abstract, the town small in the distance below.",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "value": "A song doesn’t become meaningless because it ends.",
              "speaker": null
            },
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "value": "A sunset doesn’t become worthless because it lasts only minutes.",
              "speaker": null
            },
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "value": "A childhood doesn’t become meaningless because it eventually disappears.",
              "speaker": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "the-realization-4",
          "mood": "hillside-sunrise-open",
          "video": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dofpspduc/video/upload/f_mp4,vc_h264,q_auto:eco,w_960,c_limit,ac_none,fps_24/v1786843265/the_realization_4_pijt0k.mp4",
          "image": null,
          "imageAlt": "The father standing now, fully lit by the risen sun.",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "value": "A life doesn’t need to be infinite to be meaningful.",
              "speaker": null
            },
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "value": "Perhaps meaning isn’t something that defeats death. Perhaps meaning is something we create while death is waiting.",
              "speaker": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-father-returns",
      "number": "V",
      "title": "The Father Returns",
      "status": "published",
      "teaser": null,
      "scenes": [
        {
          "id": "the-father-returns-1",
          "mood": "return-home",
          "video": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dofpspduc/video/upload/f_mp4,vc_h264,q_auto:eco,w_960,c_limit,ac_none,fps_24/v1786843265/the_father_returns_1_ivxyzw.mp4",
          "image": null,
          "imageAlt": "The father walking back toward his house in the early morning light.",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "value": "The father walks home.",
              "speaker": null
            },
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "value": "His son is awake. Still grumpy. Still imperfect. Still difficult.",
              "speaker": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "the-father-returns-2",
          "mood": "return-home",
          "video": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dofpspduc/video/upload/f_mp4,vc_h264,q_auto:eco,w_960,c_limit,ac_none,fps_24/v1786843265/the_father_returns_2_url3wp.mp4",
          "image": null,
          "imageAlt": "The boy standing in the doorway, looking at his father with a suspicious frown.",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "blockType": "dialogue",
              "value": "Where were you?",
              "speaker": "His son"
            },
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "value": "The father smiles.",
              "speaker": null
            },
            {
              "blockType": "dialogue",
              "value": "I was thinking.",
              "speaker": "The father"
            },
            {
              "blockType": "dialogue",
              "value": "About what?",
              "speaker": "His son"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "the-father-returns-3",
          "mood": "return-home",
          "video": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dofpspduc/video/upload/f_mp4,vc_h264,q_auto:eco,w_960,c_limit,ac_none,fps_24/v1786843265/the_father_returns_3_yfpjdp.mp4",
          "image": null,
          "imageAlt": "The father kneeling down to meet his son at eye level.",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "value": "He almost says it — about why he brought his son into this terrible world. Instead, he kneels.",
              "speaker": null
            },
            {
              "blockType": "dialogue",
              "value": "About how lucky I am that you’re here.",
              "speaker": "The father"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "the-father-returns-4",
          "mood": "return-home",
          "video": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dofpspduc/video/upload/f_mp4,vc_h264,q_auto:eco,w_960,c_limit,ac_none,fps_24/v1786843265/the_father_returns_4_rcnkej.mp4",
          "image": null,
          "imageAlt": "The boy tilting his head, confused, as his father laughs quietly.",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "blockType": "dialogue",
              "value": "Why?",
              "speaker": "His son"
            },
            {
              "blockType": "dialogue",
              "value": "I don’t know yet.",
              "speaker": "The father"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "the-father-returns-5",
          "mood": "return-home",
          "video": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dofpspduc/video/upload/f_mp4,vc_h264,q_auto:eco,w_960,c_limit,ac_none,fps_24/v1786843265/the_father_returns_5_nuh2ix.mp4",
          "image": null,
          "imageAlt": "The boy pulling his father by the hand toward something small and unseen just out of frame.",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "value": "Then the boy grabs his hand.",
              "speaker": null
            },
            {
              "blockType": "dialogue",
              "value": "Come look at this.",
              "speaker": "His son"
            },
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "value": "And pulls him toward something completely insignificant. Perhaps a bug. Perhaps a toy. Perhaps a drawing. Perhaps the sunrise.",
              "speaker": null
            },
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "value": "And this time... the father looks.",
              "speaker": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "final-scene",
